{{!
    @template local_awareness/media_link

    A media link as the multimedia filter wants it: a real anchor, whose href is the video and
    whose text is the video's name. helper::render_media_link() runs this through format_text(),
    where filter_mediaplugin turns it into the player the site has enabled - or leaves it a link,
    which is why it opens in a new tab when it stays one.

    Context variables required for this template:
      * url - the video link, already trimmed

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3b1aH9K0xQ4"
    }
}}
<a href="{{url}}" class="la-media-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{url}}</a>
